// Known compiler limitation (parallels physics/mod.sio and units/mod.sio):
//   `use pbpk::*` may not re-export nested names through the wildcard.
//   Use qualified paths: `use pbpk::rapamycin_2cmt::*`,
//   `use pbpk::rapamycin_params::*`, etc. This is a documented user
//   constraint, not a bug to fix in this task.
